*Key Formulae:*
- Even symmetry: $integral_0^oo g(x) d x = 1/2 integral_(-oo)^oo g(x) d x$
- Residue of order 3 pole: $"Res" = 1/2 phi''(z_0)$
- Semicircular contour: $integral_(-oo)^oo f(x) d x = 2 pi i sum_("UHP") "Res"$
